<title>HUNGARY: Agrimpex Q1-Q3 net profit up at HUF504mln.</title>
<headline>Agrimpex Q1-Q3 net profit up at HUF504mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending on September 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 96	    Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 688.1	  vs	556.5</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   615.0	  vs	439.6</p>
<p>    Group net profit		 503.6	  vs	291.1</p>
<p>     Group after-tax profit	512.3	  vs	291.1</p>
<p>     Group minority interest	 8.7 loss   vs	  0</p>
<p>    Group sales		   13,392.4	  vs   10,486.5 @</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Agrimpex Kereskedelmi Rt. The figures are consolidated and calculated according to international accounting standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
